          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 73670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizilerle değer eklemeyi ve kaldırmayı öğrenelim. Değer eklemek ve görevleri kaldırmak için dizi kullanan bu yapılacaklar listesi uygulaması gibi.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;To-Do List&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xA;            background-color: #f5f5f5;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-container {&#xA;            background-color: white;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xA;            border-radius: 10px;&#xA;            margin: 24px auto;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;        }&#xA;        h1 {&#xA;            font-size: 24px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 20px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;] {&#xA;            width: 20px;&#xA;            height: 20px;&#xA;            margin-right: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item.completed span {&#xA;            text-decoration: line-through;&#xA;            color: #ccc;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;todo-container&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h1&gt;To-Dos&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-1&quot; checked&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy clear nail polish 💅&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-2&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy soap bar 🧼&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-3&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;paint soap with nail-polish&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-4&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;casually leave soap in bathroom&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-5&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;enjoy&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;script&gt;&#xA;        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {&#xA;            const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;]');&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                checkbox.addEventListener('change', function() {&#xA;                    if (this.checked) {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                    } else {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.remove('completed');&#xA;                    }&#xA;                });&#xA;            });&#xA;&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                if (checkbox.checked) {&#xA;                    checkbox.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                }&#xA;            });&#xA;        });&#xA;    &lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Push",
            "id": 73671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"groceries\"</code> gibi bir değeri diziye eklemek için önce <code>toDo</code> dizi adını, ardından nokta <code>.</code> işaretini, sonra da <code>push(\"groceries\")</code> dizi metodunu yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>toDo</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>push(\"groceries\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Diziye <code>\"groceries\"</code> gibi bir değer eklemek için önce <code>toDo</code> dizi adını, ardından nokta <code>.</code> işaretini, sonra da <code>push(\"groceries\")</code> dizi metodunu yazarız. Yeni işi ekle ve yazdırılan dizinin sonunda <code>\"groceries\"</code> olmasını sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop(&quot;groceries&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tasks\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push(groceries)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>toDo</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>push(\"groceries\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "End of the array",
            "id": 73672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.push()</code> metoduyla bir değer eklemek, bu değeri dizinin sonuna yerleştirir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"groceries\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.push()</code> metoduyla bir değer eklemek, bu değeri dizinin sonuna yerleştirir. Yazdırılan son değerin <code>\"groceries\"</code> olmasını sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>push</code>, ardından <code>\"groceries\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "More values",
            "id": 73673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerleri virgülle <code>,</code> ayırarak <code>.push()</code> ile birden fazla değer ekleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>,</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerleri virgülle <code>,</code> ayırarak <code>.push()</code> ile birden fazla değer ekleyebiliriz. Her iki işi de tek çağrıda ekle ve <code>\"feed cat\"</code> değerinin sonda olmasını sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>,</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Pop",
            "id": 73674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizinin son öğesini kaldırmak için dizi adını <code>toDo</code>, nokta işaretini <code>.</code> ve dizi metodu <code>pop()</code>'u yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>toDo</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>pop</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store removed element",
            "id": 73676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>toDo.pop()</code> değerini bir değişkene atadığımızda, değişken kaldırdığımız değeri depolar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>chore</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>toDo.pop()</code> değerini bir değişkene atadığımızda, değişken kaldırdığımız değeri depolar. Kaldırılan değeri <code>chore</code> değişkeninde sakla ve <code>dishes</code> yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"toDo\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>chore</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 73870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir diziye değer eklemek için hangi metodu kullanırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>.push()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizide <code>\"call mom\"</code> değeri var. Hiçbir şeyi kaldırmadan <code>\"groceries\"</code> değerini hangi çağrı ekler?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.shift()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>.push()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 73871,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.push()</code> ile eklediğimiz yeni değer nereye gider?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dizinin sonunda</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dizinin başında</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dizinin sonunda.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>[\"call mom\", \"dishes\"]</code> dizisiyle başlayıp <code>.push(\"groceries\")</code> kullanıyorsun. <code>\"groceries\"</code> nereye yerleşir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dizinin sonunda</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dizinin başında</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Son değerin yerini alır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dizinin sonunda öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: More values",
            "id": 73872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.push()</code> kullanarak bir diziye kaç değer ekleyebiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İstediğimiz kadar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aynı anda yalnızca bir değer</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İstediğimiz kadar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>toDo.push(\"groceries\", \"feed cat\")</code> bu tek metot çağrısında ne ekleyebilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Her iki değeri</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca ilk değeri</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.push()</code> tek değer kabul ettiği için yalnızca bir değeri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Her iki değeri öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
