          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 73876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Etkin kullanıcılar dizisine <code>\"joe\"</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>activeUsers</code>, ardından <code>.push(\"joe\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizi <code>[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]</code> olarak yazdırılmalı. Etkin kullanıcılardan hiçbirini kaldırmadan <code>\"joe\"</code> değerini ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".push(joe)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>activeUsers</code>, ardından <code>.push(\"joe\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
