            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişken oluşturup değerini <code>themes.pop()</code> olarak ayarlayarak dizinin son değerini kaldır ve görüntüle. <code>dark mode</code> yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" current = themes.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(current);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"themes\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"themes.push()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dark mode\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>current</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>themes.pop()</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
